WEBVTT

00:00:29.435 --> 00:00:31.107
je izkušnja biti v omari

00:00:31.107 --> 00:00:34.438
in stopiti iz nje univerzalna.

00:00:34.438 --> 00:00:40.030
Strašljiva je, sovražimo jo 
in moramo jo napraviti.

00:00:40.030 --> 00:00:41.399
Pred leti

00:00:41.399 --> 00:00:45.170
sem delala v lokalni restavraciji

00:00:45.170 --> 00:00:47.241
South Side Walnut Cafe

00:00:47.241 --> 00:00:49.956
in takrat sem imela faze

00:00:49.956 --> 00:00:53.521
militantne lezbične intenzivnosti:

00:00:53.521 --> 00:00:55.296
nisem si brila pazduh,

00:00:55.296 --> 00:00:58.845
Ani DiFranco sem citirala
kot svete besede.

00:00:58.845 --> 00:01:01.100
Odvisno od tega,
kako široke hlače sem nosila